## Referencial para posicionamento##


<div style="width: 200px; height: 300px; border: 2px dotted; margin: auto;">

<div style="width: 170px; height: 270px; margin: 10px; background-color: orange; opacity: .5;">

<div style="width: 150px; height: 50px; background-color: #228; opacity: .5;"></div>

<div style="width: 150px; height: 50px; background-color: #228; opacity: 1; position: static; "></div>

